{"slug":"freelo","name":"Freelo","description":"Freelo is a comprehensive project management and team collaboration tool designed to streamline workflows, enhance productivity, and facilitate seamless communication among team members. It offers features such as task management, time tracking, file sharing, and project planning, making it an ideal solution for businesses and teams looking to improve their project execution and collaboration efforts.","icon":"https://stuff.thingsofbrand.com/freelo.io/images/img6_freelo.png","domain":"freelo.io","rank":799,"labels":["Project Management","Team Collaboration","Productivity"],"categories":["project-management"],"eventsRead":true,"events":[{"n":"Create Project","d":"Create a new project in Freelo.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Invited Projects","d":"Retrieve invited projects, with optional page and selected response fields.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"New Task Created","d":"Triggered when a new task is created in a project.","t":"trigger","k":"polling"},{"n":"Project Created","d":"Triggered when a project is created.","t":"trigger","k":"polling"},{"n":"Archive Project","d":"Archives a project in Freelo.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Activate Project","d":"Activates an existing project in Freelo.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Delete Project","d":"Delete an existing project in Freelo.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Get Project","d":"Get Project by ID in Freelo.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Archived Projects","d":"List archived projects, optionally paging results and returning only selected fields.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Projects","d":"Lists projects from your Freelo account.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Create Tasklist","d":"Create a new tasklist in a project.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Tasklists","d":"Lists all tasklists in a selected Freelo project.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Create Task","d":"Creates a task with a title, due date, assignees, labels, and optional subt